    "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img class=\"  aligncenter wp-image-236\" title=\"ncbc-logo\" src=\"https://cfi.co/awards/wp-content/uploads/2012/10/ncbc-logo.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>The judges applauded NCB’s 2011 M&amp;A deal ($500 million) consolidating six construction companies. </strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">This was the largest M&amp;A deal in the region from Saudi Arabia’s biggest asset manager ($11.75 billion). This was the first subsidiary of a Saudi Bank to be licenced by the Capital Market Authority for Investment Management and Asset Management in Saudi Arabia.</p>",
